    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f53ee37f0a8e4b488aeacd9df18111db",
      "statement": "A suspension-triggered taxable-fixed-income band breach is not automatically rebalanced; when the municipal overweight is suspended, its paired investment-grade corporate underweight is suspended too and both return to neutral.",
